<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 18A of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the word \"section\" the words \"5B\". Amendment of section 47"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 47 the following section: \"Appeal to Customs Appeal Tribunal 47. (1) Any person aggrieved by a decision of the Director General may, except in any matter relating to compound or subsection 67(3), within thirty days of being notified of such decision in writing, appeal to the Customs Appeal Tribunal whose decision shall be final. (2) All provisions relating to the Customs Appeal Tribunal shall be applicable to this Act.\". Deletion of section 47A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 47A. Amendment of section 74"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@/~cl_7__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/41/eng@> .
